msgstr "Colors"

#: rc.cpp:13 rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"You can choose either the predefined LCD look or define a custom color set."
msgstr ""
"Podetz triar bé l'aspecte LCD predefinit on definir un joc de colors a mida."

